    "description": "<table style=\"width:100%; margin-top:2em; border:2px solid #999; font-size:105%; text-align:center; background:#00008B;\">\n <tbody>\n  <tr>\n   <td><i><b>This <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Homebrew_Content\" title=\"Homebrew Content\">Homebrew Content</a> has been <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Tested\" title=\"Category:Tested\">Tested</a> per the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Untested\" title=\"Category:Untested\">Untested</a> guidelines. Whether or not it can be used is, as always, the prerogative of the Gamemaster.</b></i></td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><p><i>Dexterous Feint Feat data created by Wikia user SunsetMage001.</i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species_Feats\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Species Feats\">Species Feats</a></i></p><p>You can use your natural speed in place of your charm to confuse your enemies.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Blood_Carver\" title=\"Blood Carver\">Blood Carver</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Noghri\" title=\"Noghri\">Noghri</a>, or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Terrelian\" title=\"Terrelian\">Terrelian</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> You can use your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> bonus in place of your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> bonus when using the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feint\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feint\">Feint</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Group_Feint\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Group Feint\">Group Feint</a> applications of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> skill.</p>",
